-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ה/7 (21.4.2025): עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016 לעובדי הוראה בגני ילדים, בתי ספר יסודיים, חטיבת ביניים ומכללות להכשרת עובדי הוראה
-- The index update of 1.1.2025 of the 2016 shekel supplement for
-- kindergartens, primary schools, junior-high schools and teacher-training
-- colleges: one amount per Ofek Hadash grade up to 4.5 and one for
-- everyone else, paid with arrears from January 2025.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in school months of תשפ"ה
-- (common.l4: September 2024 = 1, January 2025 = 5, April 2025 = 8).

§ `תשפ"ה/7 עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016 בחינוך היסודי`

-- akn:hc_1/p1 akn:hc_1/p2 akn:hc_1/p3 akn:hc_1/p4 akn:hc_1/p5 akn:hc_1/p6 akn:hc_1/p7 akn:hc_1/p8 akn:hc_1/p9 akn:hc_1/p10 akn:hc_1/p11 akn:hc_1/p12 The letterhead, date (21.4.2025), reference number, circular number, addressee, greeting and subject line; no rule.

DECLARE `update action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the updated supplement with arrears from January 2025` HAS `monthly amount paid` IS A NUMBER

§§ `Purpose and linkage`

-- p13 and p14: under the wage agreements with the teachers' union of
-- 30.9.2016 (6ד) and 19.3.2017 and circular תשפ"ד/6, the 2016 shekel
-- supplement is linked to the consumer price index; this circular
-- publishes its update for the period from 1.1.2025.
@ref akn:hc_1/p13 akn:hc_1/p14
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2016 shekel supplement is linked to the consumer price index` IS TRUE

-- p15: the December 2024 index (published January 2025) against the
-- December 2023 index (published January 2024). The index values are not
-- in the circular; they are inputs.
@ref akn:hc_1/p15
GIVEN `index of December 2024` IS A NUMBER, `index of December 2023` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the linkage ratio` `index of December 2024` `index of December 2023` IS
    `index of December 2024` DIVIDED BY `index of December 2023`

§§ `Application`

-- akn:hc_1/p16 The heading "תחולה"; no rule.

DECLARE `stage of education` IS ONE OF
    kindergarten
    `primary school`
    `junior high school`
    `teacher-training college`
    `upper division`

DECLARE `primary-stage employee` HAS
    `graded on the teaching-staff scale`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed by a supervised owning body` IS A BOOLEAN
    `stage`                                IS A `stage of education`
    `employed under Ofek Hadash`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `Ofek Hadash grade`                    IS A NUMBER  @desc the grade in the Ofek Hadash salary tables for academic and non-academic teachers (half grades exist); 0 where the employee has none

-- p17 and p18: every employee graded as teaching staff, employed by an
-- owning body the Ministry supervises, at one of the four stages — in Ofek
-- Hadash or not.
@ref akn:hc_1/p17 akn:hc_1/p18
GIVEN e IS A `primary-stage employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular applies to` e IF
        e's `graded on the teaching-staff scale`
    AND e's `employed by a supervised owning body`
    AND NOT e's `stage` EQUALS `upper division`

§§ `The amounts from 1.1.2025`

@desc A row of the amounts from 1.1.2025: a grade in the Ofek Hadash salary tables and the 2016 shekel supplement for a full position at it.
DECLARE `grade amount` HAS
    `at grade`         IS A NUMBER
    `monthly amount`   IS A NUMBER

-- p19-p21, in the printed order. The 2.5 row prints "1.012.99", a
-- thousands separator printed as a point; it is read as 1,012.99, the only
-- value between its neighbours 1,101.37 and 924.62.
@ref akn:hc_1/p19 akn:hc_1/p20 akn:hc_1/p21
`the amounts by Ofek Hadash grade` MEANS
    LIST `grade amount` 1   1247.41,
         `grade amount` 1.5 1174.39,
         `grade amount` 2   1101.37,
         `grade amount` 2.5 1012.99,
         `grade amount` 3   924.62,
         `grade amount` 3.5 877.31,
         `grade amount` 4   829.99,
         `grade amount` 4.5 730.26

-- p22: every other employee the circular applies to, in Ofek Hadash or not.
@ref akn:hc_1/p22
`the amount for every other employee` MEANS 630.84

GIVEN e IS A `primary-stage employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2016 shekel supplement for a full position from 1.1.2025` e IS
    IF NOT `the circular applies to` e
    THEN 0
    ELSE IF e's `employed under Ofek Hadash`
         THEN CONSIDER filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `at grade` EQUALS e's `Ofek Hadash grade`) `the amounts by Ofek Hadash grade`
              WHEN r FOLLOWED BY rest THEN r's `monthly amount`
              WHEN EMPTY THEN `the amount for every other employee`
         ELSE `the amount for every other employee`

-- p23 and p24: the other rules for paying the supplement (for a part-time
-- position among them) are those of circular תשע"ז/3 at the address given.
-- They are not in this circular; the share of a position is an input.
@ref akn:hc_1/p23 akn:hc_1/p24
GIVEN e IS A `primary-stage employee`, `share of the full supplement under circular 5777/3` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2016 shekel supplement from 1.1.2025` e `share of the full supplement under circular 5777/3` IS
    `the 2016 shekel supplement for a full position from 1.1.2025` e TIMES `share of the full supplement under circular 5777/3`

-- p25: the reimbursement went out in the March 2025 payments (paid early
-- April 2025); the supplement is paid at its updated value with retroactive
-- differences from January 2025.
@ref akn:hc_1/p25
GIVEN e IS A `primary-stage employee`, `share of the full supplement under circular 5777/3` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `update action`
DECIDE `pay the updated value from January 2025` e `share of the full supplement under circular 5777/3` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the updated supplement with arrears from January 2025` a
          PROVIDED a AT LEAST `the 2016 shekel supplement from 1.1.2025` e `share of the full supplement under circular 5777/3`
    WITHIN `month number` August
    LEST  BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/7: the 2016 shekel supplement is paid at its updated value, with arrears, from January 2025"

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off, signatures and the list of copies; no rule.

-- Examples.
`a grade-3 kindergarten teacher` MEANS
    `primary-stage employee` WITH
        `graded on the teaching-staff scale`   IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised owning body` IS TRUE
        `stage`                                IS kindergarten
        `employed under Ofek Hadash`           IS TRUE
        `Ofek Hadash grade`                    IS 3

`a grade-6 primary teacher` MEANS
    `primary-stage employee` WITH
        `graded on the teaching-staff scale`   IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised owning body` IS TRUE
        `stage`                                IS `primary school`
        `employed under Ofek Hadash`           IS TRUE
        `Ofek Hadash grade`                    IS 6

`a college lecturer outside Ofek Hadash` MEANS
    `primary-stage employee` WITH
        `graded on the teaching-staff scale`   IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised owning body` IS TRUE
        `stage`                                IS `teacher-training college`
        `employed under Ofek Hadash`           IS FALSE
        `Ofek Hadash grade`                    IS 0

#ASSERT `the 2016 shekel supplement for a full position from 1.1.2025` `a grade-3 kindergarten teacher` EQUALS 924.62
#ASSERT `the 2016 shekel supplement for a full position from 1.1.2025` `a grade-6 primary teacher` EQUALS 630.84
#ASSERT `the 2016 shekel supplement for a full position from 1.1.2025` `a college lecturer outside Ofek Hadash` EQUALS 630.84

-- Every grade row pays more than the amount for everyone else.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD r's `monthly amount` GREATER THAN `the amount for every other employee`) `the amounts by Ofek Hadash grade`

#TRACE `pay the updated value from January 2025` `a grade-3 kindergarten teacher` 1 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the updated supplement with arrears from January 2025` 924.62 AT 9
#TRACE `pay the updated value from January 2025` `a grade-3 kindergarten teacher` 1 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the updated supplement with arrears from January 2025` 896.00 AT 9
